abstract: >
  Multi-stage processing pipeline for moored oceanographic array observations: converts raw instrument files (Sea-Bird, RBR, Nortek, RDI) to QC-flagged, CF-compliant NetCDF and generates self-contained HTML mooring recovery reports.
